# Trota OS VR — added to the desktop packages when the ISO is built with
# TROTA_FLAVOR=vr (scripts/build/build-iso.sh, docs/editions.md).
# Only packages from the Ubuntu archive: WiVRn and Steam are installed
# on request from Flathub by the Trota VR application (trota-vr package).
# Vulkan drivers, vulkan-tools and gamemode are already in applications.list.
monado-service           # open source OpenXR runtime (PC VR headsets)
monado-cli
libopenxr-loader1        # OpenXR loader used by VR applications
libopenxr1-monado        # Monado runtime library, registered as the default OpenXR runtime
xr-hardware              # udev rules: headsets usable without root
steam-devices            # udev rules: Valve Index, Vive and controllers (multiverse, rules only)
